get.description:
Retrieves the specified certificate library item.
Note: This API also supports a former (erroneously spelt) alternate path /cetificateLibrary/{id}
as a Deprecated API (deprecated-in and removed after API version 36.0)

put.description:
Updates the specified certificate library item. Only the alias and description fields may be edited
Note: This API also supports a former (erroneously spelt) alternate path /cetificateLibrary/{id}
as a Deprecated API (deprecated-in and removed after API version 36.0)

delete.description:
Delete the specified certificate library item. Only items that are not in use can be deleted.
Note: This API also supports a former (erroneously spelt) alternate path /cetificateLibrary/{id}
as a Deprecated API (deprecated-in and removed after API version 36.0)

hooks.description:
A mapping defining which behaviors should be invoked upon specific lifecycle events,
like PreCreate, PostCreate, PostUpdate, PreDelete, PostDelete. For example:
"hooks": { "PostCreate": "urn:vcloud:behavior-interface:postCreateHook:vendorA:containerCluster:1.0.0" }

cross-reference.description:
A filter to return all Content Libraries that are scoped to the specified project.
Example usage:
filter=projectId==urn:vcloud:projectAssignment:${UUID}

A filter to return all content library items that are scoped to the specified project.
Example usage:
filter=projectId==urn:vcloud:projectAssignment:${UUID}

A filter to look up infra policies that are compatible with the given region.
Supported filters:
  region==urn:vcloud:region:${UUID}

A filter to look up infra policies that are compatible with the given zone.
Supported filters:
  zone==urn:vcloud:zone:${UUID}
